msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"This concludes the basic battle tutorial.\r\n"
"Now show those thugs what you can do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"During <Color:109,193,240,255>Heat Mode<Color:Default>, you can use secret "
"techniques called <Color:7>Heat Actions<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"Various conditions, such as holding specific weapons, will enable you\r\n"
"to use these moves.\r\n"
"<Sign:35><Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> will appear at the top right "
"of the screen\r\n"
"when a <Color:7>Heat Action<Color:Default> is available."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"The blue gauge at the upper left of the screen is called the "
"<Color:109,193,240,255>Heat Gauge<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"This gauge will fill up as you attack enemies.\r\n"
"Once it's charged, you will enter <Color:109,193,240,255>Heat "
"Mode<Color:Default> and be surrounded\r\n"
"by a blue aura. This mode comes with many advantages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Objects that have a <Sign:23> over them can be grabbed just like enemies.\r\n"
"After grabbing an object, press <Action:Battle_Normal_Attack@Combat> or "
"<Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> to use it as a weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Battle_Drop_Weapon@Combat> near an enemy to grab him.\r\n"
"While holding the enemy, press <Action:Battle_Drop_Weapon@Combat> to "
"throw\r\n"
"or <Action:Battle_Normal_Attack@Combat> or "
"<Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> to attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> during a <Color:7>Rush "
"Combo<Color:Default> to execute a powerful\r\n"
"<Color:7>Finishing Blow<Color:Default>. The type and effect of the "
"<Color:7>Finishing Blow<Color:Default>\r\n"
"will vary depending on how many times you pressed "
"<Action:Battle_Normal_Attack@Combat> beforehand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Battle_Normal_Attack@Combat> repeatedly to execute the most\r\n"
"basic type of attack: the <Color:7>Rush Combo<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3132"
msgid "Tutorial Complete"
msgstr ""

